o isaacson’s biography of elon", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-09-24T15:48:51Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "Else i had no idea 😀", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-09-24T15:49:03Z", "username": "Prathamesh", "text": "I know it because I played too much Need for Speed 😂", "role": "answer_reveal", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-09-24T15:49:04Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "Nobody can mess with Deven Chaudhary", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-09-24T15:50:08Z", "username": "Prathamesh", "text": "This is my story of visiting LA too. A lot of deja vu to the point I considered reincarnation 😂\nThen I realized this is just the effect of a lot of GTA", "role": "answer_reveal", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-09-24T15:50:17Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "This was supposed to be an homage to Dilip chabaria right? 😂", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-09-24T15:50:25Z", "username": "Prathamesh", "text": "Yes", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-09-24T15:51:49Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "At one point in school i was so gta sa brained i really thought the top secret compound was called Area 69", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-09-24T15:52:21Z", "username": "Abhishek S", "text": "I'm still on Deven Chaudhary. Who's that?", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-09-24T15:52:38Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "The original designer of the car", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-09-24T15:52:53Z", "username": "Abhishek S", "text": "Oh, lol", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-09-24T15:53:01Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "Think he had some big car modification business", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-09-24T15:53:10Z", "username": "Prathamesh", "text": "Ajay uncle in the movie", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-09-24T15:53:12Z", "username": "Abhishek S", "text": "So they named the character with the same initials", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-09-24T15:53:34Z", "username": "Lzafeer Ahmad B F", "text": "He even launched the car also", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-09-24T15:53:34Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "Yup", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-09-24T15:53:37Z", "username": "Lzafeer Ahmad B F", "text": "Later", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-09-24T15:53:39Z", "username": "Lzafeer Ahmad B F", "text": "As Avanti", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-09-24T15:53:41Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "And the logo was there too", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-09-24T15:53:43Z", "username": "Lzafeer Ahmad B F", "text": "With 180hp", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-09-24T15:53:43Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "The rival company was called Four Foxes 🤣", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-09-24T15:54:08Z", "username": "Lzafeer Ahmad B F", "text": "Or maybe that was top speed.", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-09-24T15:54:15Z", "username": "Ricky", "text": "This reminds me of a funda:\nAjay Devgn's son married Ajay Devgn's daughter. Put funda.", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-09-24T15:54:33Z", "username": "Khandoba", "text": "Tarzan meets Drishyam", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-09-24T15:54:50Z", "username": "Prathamesh", "text": "Audi vs Lancia rally battle is still one of my favourite car stories\nhttps://youtu.be/ZZ9biQDVZSY?si=QP09MG_2H9QyXg8o", "role": "answer_reveal", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-09-24T15:54:58Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "Good one", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-09-24T15:55:47Z", "username": "Abhishek S", "text": "I've never seen Tarzan the wonder car. Only seen the Only Desi revisit of it.", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-09-24T15:56:10Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "Wait what is this?", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-09-24T15:56:11Z", "username": "Abhishek S", "text": "https://youtu.be/kDe0mCPzJCo?si=LfNYOUh0xftpIFI-", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}]